00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:03.000
<v Host>Japan won the gold medal in this final.

00:03:03.599 --> 00:03:05.496
<v Vocab>取る

00:03:05.895 --> 00:03:08.343
<v Host>It means to take, or to win.

00:03:08.943 --> 00:03:16.936
<v Slow>6つの種目の合計は、251.928点でした。

00:03:17.735 --> 00:03:22.223
